      "kind": "implementation",
      "file": "implementation/fixture-revision-own-state/release-fixture-manifested-revisions.md",
      "title": "Give the canonical fixture and seed setup's manifested revisions their own released state",
      "summary": "The shared fixture builder, the production seed script, and the ad-hoc case built by manifest-collects-survive-release.spec.ts now directly write each manifest-referenced hypothesis-revision's own state to released right after the case version that manifests it is released, restoring the protection migration 0021 moved onto that column.",
      "task": "task/fixture-revision-own-state/release-fixture-manifested-revisions"
    },
    {
      "id": "implementation/hypothesis-revision-own-state/refuse-altering-a-released-revision",
      "kind": "implementation",
      "file": "implementation/hypothesis-revision-own-state/refuse-altering-a-released-revision.md",
      "title": "Refuse a released hypothesis-revision's alteration from its own state",
      "summary": "A migration that moves the schema's release-conditioned refusal on hypothesis_revisions and hypothesis_revision_collects off the case-version join and onto the revision's own state column.",
      "task": "task/hypothesis-revision-own-state/refuse-altering-a-released-revision"
    },
    {
      "id": "implementation/hypothesis-revision-own-state/store-the-revisions-own-state",
      "kind": "implementation",
      "file": "implementation/hypothesis-revision-own-state/store-the-revisions-own-state.md",
      "title": "Store the hypothesis-revision's own state column and write draft on insert",
      "summary": "Adds hypothesis_revisions.state (draft/released, NOT NULL, CHECK-constrained) via a new numbered migration, and makes the insert write path name it explicitly as draft, leaving the overwrite path untouched.",
      "task": "task/hypothesis-revision-own-state/store-the-revisions-own-state"
    },
    {
      "id": "implementation/obsolete-protection-basis-tests/repoint-the-repository-overwrite-refusal-test",
      "kind": "implementation",
      "file": "implementation/obsolete-protection-basis-tests/repoint-the-repository-overwrite-refusal-test.md",
      "title": "Repoint the repository's overwrite-refusal test onto the revision's own state",
      "summary": "Replaced the obsolete manifest-referenced-basis overwrite test in the relational case store repository spec with a test asserting the opposite direction of the state-only rule — that a released case version's manifest reference alone, over a draft-state revision, does not refuse an overwrite — leaving the already-correct sibling as the file's one assertion of the refusal itself.",
      "task": "task/obsolete-protection-basis-tests/repoint-the-repository-overwrite-refusal-test"
    },
    {
      "id": "implementation/obsolete-protection-basis-tests/retire-case-version-lifecycle-manifest-basis-assertion",
