      "file": "proof/hypothesis-revision-own-state/store-the-revisions-own-state.md",
      "title": "Store the hypothesis-revision's own state — proof",
      "summary": "Integration tests over a fresh migration replay and over ReviseHypothesisOperation's own write path, proving the state column exists, is CHECK-constrained to draft/released, is not nullable, defaults draft for a row this migration did not create, and is written draft on insert while left untouched on overwrite.",
      "task": "task/hypothesis-revision-own-state/store-the-revisions-own-state"
    }
